  <Strings>
    <Section>Story</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>13124</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>カツカレー、シーフードピラフ
ワンタンメンに山盛りポテトサラダ
チーズ盛合わせと太巻き寿司三本</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Curry, seafood pilaf, wonton noodles, a mountain of potato salad, a cheese board, three rolls of sushi...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>13248</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>デザートにトマト五つと
スイカ一玉。最後のシメに
牛乳２リットル一気飲み……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Then for desert, five tomatoes and a whole watermelon. And by the end of the day about two liters of milk...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>13676</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Hisui&gt;
その料理名の羅列はなんだ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Hisui&gt;, what is the meaning of this list of dishes?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>13800</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>今日の&lt;Ines&gt;の昼飯だ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's what &lt;Ines&gt; ate for lunch today.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>13924</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……ばかな！
&lt;Ines&gt;は、ガルデニアに匹敵する
吸収能力を備えているのか!?</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Impossible! Does &lt;Ines&gt; have consumption abilites comparable to Gardenia?!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>14288</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>リチア様でも、最後の
スイカ半玉と牛乳１リットル分は
食べきれないだろう</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Even Master Lithia would struggle to eat half a watermelon, and only manage one liter of milk.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>14552</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>他は食いきれんのかよッ!?</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Even half is insane though!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>14880</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>だが、不可思議だ。
それだけの食料が
どこに消えるというのだ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>However, it truly is a mystery. Just where does all the food go?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>15004</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そりゃあ、やっぱ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We'll, it's gotta be....</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>15096</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>大量の食料が消える先は……
・胃袋だよな？
・胸……なのか!?</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Where does all the food go?
・In their stomach, yeah?
・It can't be... her chest, right?!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>15236</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>胃袋だよな？
そーそ、知ってるか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>In their stomach, yeah? Don't tell me you didn't know that.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>15748</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Ines&gt;の
バカでかいリュックって
ほとんど自分の食料なんだぜ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That huge bag &lt;Ines&gt; carts around is pretty much chockers with food.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>16316</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そんなコスト最悪の
運び屋が儲かる訳ねぇっつーの</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>There's no way she's makin' a living as a courier like that.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>17132</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あとな、ヘソを出してるのも
腹のキツさを和らげるため……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I bet the reason she's got her belly out is 'cause she gets too full to fit into anything...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>17680</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あれ!?
どこ行くんだ、&lt;Kunzite&gt;……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Huh?! Where's he off to...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>18448</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ぎゃあぁ〜〜〜っ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>GAAAH~!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>19996</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>胸……なのか!?</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText/>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>To Do</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>20120</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>否。
その説は否定する</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Negative. I refute that theory.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>20948</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なぜならば、リチア様も
&lt;Ines&gt;に匹敵する食物を
摂取しているにもかかわらず</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Master Lithia consumes a similar amount of food that &lt;Ines&gt; does...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>21072</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>リチア様の胸部は
完全に平坦だからだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>So If that were the case, wouldn't Master Lithia's bust size be larger?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>21692</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>センサーが実測した数値データに
おいても、リチア様の胸部の
完ぺきな平面性は実証済みで……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I can confirm with data gathered by my sensors that Master Lithia's chest is flat, it's a proven fact...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>22248</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>む!?
どこへ行くのだ、&lt;Hisui&gt;……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hm?! &lt;Hisui&gt;, why are you running...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>22996</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>リ、リチア様……!?
ぐあぁぁーーーーーッッ!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Master Lithia...?! Ghh!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
